# This repo is meant to hold ONLY the deployable dashboard page (index.html).
# Everything else in this working folder — old draft versions of the dashboard
# (which have real customer data embedded in them, unlike the current one) and
# raw data exports (CSV/XLSX) — must NEVER be committed here, since this repo
# is public. Ignore everything by default, then explicitly allow just the files
# this deployment actually needs.
*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!README.md
!CNAME
!manifest.json
!sw.js
!icons/
!icons/*.png

# notifier/ is a separate deployable (Vercel serverless functions) — no secrets or
# customer data live in these files, only code; env vars/credentials are set in the
# Vercel project itself, never committed. See notifier/.gitignore for its own
# node_modules/.env exclusions.
!notifier/
!notifier/.gitignore
!notifier/README.md
!notifier/package.json
!notifier/vercel.json
!notifier/api/
!notifier/api/**
!notifier/lib/
!notifier/lib/**
